<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 78, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>米家 UI：功能不变，只动观感</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 16, padding: '5px 16px', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>主讲 · D · 前端页面</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '18px 40px 10px 40px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='star' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>设计语言</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>浅灰底 + 白色大圆角卡片 + 品牌绿强调 + 首页天空蓝渐变天气卡；对照米家截图逐页校色，接口与交互零改动。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='cog' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>17 种专属面板</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>每种设备按语义设计控件：胶囊选项（模式 / 档位）、滑杆（亮度 / 温度 / 音量）、开关圆点，进详情页一看就会用。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='cloud' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>天气面板</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>首页顶部天气卡：当前天气 + 未来预报，60 分钟自动刷新，城市可切换。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10, marginBottom: 8 }}>
                    <FAIcon name='copy' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>组件复用</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>DeviceCard / WeatherPanel / EnvironmentPanel 等 8 个复用组件——改一处，全端页面同步生效。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 66, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 28px', gap: 14 }}>
            <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>UI 重做后 HAP 全量编译 2.89 MB 一次通过，功能与改造前完全一致。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智慧家居 App（仿米家）· 课程结项答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>19 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
